  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most widely adopted open pathology foundation model — 45k+ monthly HuggingFace downloads, Nature Medicine 2024, state-of-the-art across 34 clinical tasks. Assess rather than Adopt due to CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0 licence: free for non-commercial academic research only. Commercial rights are exclusively held by Modella AI (Mahmood Lab spin-off, since acquired by AstraZeneca) — commercial use requires approval via the Mass General Brigham Innovation Office. Registration with institutional email required for HuggingFace access. Benchmark-contamination-free by design. Essential reference model for computational pathology AI research; organisations seeking commercial deployment must engage MGB Innovation.",
